    "group": "Guardian Battlehost",
    "cp": 1,
    "summary": "If an enemy destroys your DIRE AVENGERS or GUARDIANS in its Shooting phase or in the Fight phase, select a WAR WALKERS unit. Once that enemy finishes making its attacks, the walkers may fire back using your Shooting phase rules if that enemy is a legal target and the walkers are eligible to shoot. They must fire at the triggering unit. Each battle allows a single use.",
